# QT-004: Linear Estimate Sync: Push storyPoints/estimatedHours to Linear's Issue Estimate Field

## Tasks

- [ ] **1.0** Team Configuration and Caching
  - [ ] 1.1 Add fetchTeamIssueEstimationType() to linear-service.ts following fetchTeamWorkflowStates pattern
