  - [ ] 2.2 Implement Fibonacci scale mapping (0,1,2,3,5,8,13,21) with nearest-value snapping
  - [ ] 2.3 Implement Linear scale mapping (0,1,2,3,4,5) with nearest-value snapping
  - [ ] 2.4 Implement Exponential scale mapping (0,1,2,4,8,16) with nearest-value snapping
