  - [ ] 5.4 Add error handling for Linear API estimate field validation failures
- [ ] **6.0** Comprehensive Test Coverage
  - [ ] 6.1 Add Fibonacci snapping tests: OP 4→Linear 5, OP 7→Linear 8 in linear-estimate-sync.test.ts
  - [ ] 6.2 Add Linear scale snapping tests: OP 3.5→Linear 4, OP 5.1→Linear 5
  - [ ] 6.3 Add Exponential scale snapping tests: OP 3→Linear 4, OP 6→Linear 8
