  - [ ] 6.5 Add team tShirt test: skipped with single warning log
  - [ ] 6.6 Add idempotent re-push test: updateIssue receives no estimate property
  - [ ] 6.7 Add missing storyPoints test: artifact without estimate frontmatter pushes successfully
  - [ ] 6.8 Add edge case tests: zero estimates, boundary values, invalid scales
- [ ] **7.0** Documentation and Polish
  - [ ] 7.1 Add 'Estimate sync' subsection to status-sync section in docs/CLI.md
